## solutions

#### iterative

```js
const reverseList = (head) => {
  let current = head;
  let prev = null;
  while (current !== null) {
    const next = current.next;
    current.next = prev;
    prev = current;
    current = next;
  }
  return prev;
};
```

- n = number of nodes
- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(1)

#### recursive

```js
const reverseList = (head, prev = null) => {
  if (head === null) return prev;
  const next = head.next;
  head.next = prev;
  return reverseList(next, head);
};
```

- n = number of nodes
- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(n)

